						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-32f8fc2c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="32f8fc2c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Overview | Omaxe The Ambrosia
</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-51220e9e elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider" data-id="51220e9e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="divider.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-divider">
			<span class="elementor-divider-separator">
						</span>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-395d522d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="395d522d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4330399 elementor-list-item-link-inline elementor-align-left elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list" data-id="4330399" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-list.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><ul class="elementor-icon-list-items"><li class="elementor-icon-list-item"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2fd6f20e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2fd6f20e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Omaxe Ambrosia is the new name for luxurious and comfortable living. Ambrosia offers 3 BHK flats in Chandigarh with lavish amenities. It has five giant parks, one of which measures 8-acre and the others being half an acre each. These spaces are a reflection of exquisite living experience with a blend of green spaces to provide freshness. There are musical fountains to soothe the morning hues and evening musings which can make your living a wonderful experience. With all the amenities available there, you need not worry about travelling long distances. The landscape is well developed and has tree-lined avenues so that you always stay close to nature. The additional facility of connectivity to the nearby areas just adds on to the list of perks. If you want to enjoy, play, and interact, you can simply walk down to the five-star luxury club, which is fully functional and open for the residents. The luxurious amenities and the most lavish property are available at rates which may surprise you.</p></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-30e0f01 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list" data-id="30e0f01" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-list.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><ul class="elementor-icon-list-items"><li class="elementor-icon-list-item"> </li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div></div>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-21e7587a elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box" data-id="21e7587a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-box.default">
